<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-color-mode="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ASUS GearLink | ROG FALCHION ACE HFX 灯效设置中心</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --font-family: "Segoe UI", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            --rog-red: #ff1929;
            --rog-red-dark: #b80010;
            --rog-cyan: #00f0ff;
            --rog-cyan-dark: #00b4d8;
            --bg-body: #07090d;
            --bg-stage: #0c0f15;
            --bg-panel: #10141c;
            --bg-card: #151922;
            --bg-card-hover: #1c222e;
            --bg-active: #202735;
            --border-subtle: #1e2430;
            --border-card: #28303f;
            --border-active: #ff1929;
            --text-primary: #e6ecf5;
            --text-secondary: #8c97a8;
            --text-muted: #535d6e;
            --radius-sm: 3px;
            --radius-md: 6px;
            --radius-lg: 10px;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-family);
            background-color: var(--bg-body);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            user-select: none;
        }

        /* 顶部 GearLink 风格导航栏 */
        header {
            background-color: rgba(13, 16, 23, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            padding: 10px 32px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .header-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
        .rog-logo {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rog-red), #880010);
            border-radius: 4px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.35);
        }
        .rog-logo svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; fill: #fff; }

        .brand-info h1 {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .brand-info h1 span.tag {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            background: rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.4);
            color: var(--rog-red);
        }
        .brand-info p { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary); }

        .header-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
        .status-badge {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            background-color: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.3);
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #00e676;
        }
        .status-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            background-color: #00e676;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00e676;
            animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse-dot {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0.5; }
        }

        .btn-rog {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rog-red), #b00012);
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 7px 18px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn-rog:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.6);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* 页面主体内容容器 */
        main {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 1240px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 18px auto 36px;
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        /* ========================================================
           1. 顶部舞台：ASUS GearLink 键盘视觉模块
           ======================================================== */
        .stage-container {
            background-color: var(--bg-stage);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 22px 18px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
            position: relative;
        }

        .stage-header {
            width: 908px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .stage-title {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .stage-fps-badge {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--rog-cyan);
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 2px 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        /* 官方 GearLink 规范命名：device-keyboard-module__keyboard */
        .device-keyboard-module__keyboard {
            position: relative;
            width: 908px;
            height: auto;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: #0f1218;
            border: 8px solid #1a1e27;
            box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03);
            user-select: none;
        }

        .device-keyboard-module__keyboard_base-layer {
            padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #0a0d12;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .device-keyboard-module__keyboard-row {
            position: relative;
            height: 50px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        /* 68 键键帽规范命名：device-keyboard-module__key */
        .device-keyboard-module__key {
            position: relative;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: #181d26;
            border: 1px solid #28303f;
            outline: 2px solid transparent;
            outline-offset: 1px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.08s, box-shadow 0.08s, transform 0.06s;
            box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .device-keyboard-module__key:active,
        .device-keyboard-module__key.key-pressed {
            transform: translateY(2px);
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 16px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) !important;
        }
        .device-keyboard-module__key .key-label {
            pointer-events: none;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            transition: color 0.1s;
        }
        .device-keyboard-module__key .key-sublabel {
            font-size: 8px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
            margin-top: -2px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* 选项卡切换条 */
        .tab-nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .tab-btn {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .tab-btn:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }
        .tab-btn.active {
            color: var(--rog-red);
            border-bottom-color: var(--rog-red);
        }

        /* ========================================================
           2. 核心双栏设置中枢 (完美复刻参考图片布局)
           ======================================================== */
        .gearlink-main-panel {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 340px;
            gap: 20px;
            background-color: var(--bg-panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 24px 26px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        /* ----- 左侧：基本效果网格 ----- */
        .effects-left-section {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            padding-right: 12px;
        }

        /* 赛博斜向警戒斜纹底层图案 (参考图右下角底纹) */
        .effects-left-section::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            right: 0;
            width: 140px;
            height: 110px;
            pointer-events: none;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                -45deg,
                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 0,
                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 10px,
                transparent 10px,
                transparent 22px
            );
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* 顶部开关与标题 */
        .effects-top-bar {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        /* 赛博青色拨码开关 [ON / OFF] */
        .cyber-switch {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
            width: 48px;
            height: 22px;
            background: #1e2430;
            border-radius: 2px;
            position: relative;
            border: 1px solid #333d4e;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .cyber-switch.on {
            background: var(--rog-cyan-dark);
            border-color: var(--rog-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
        }
        .cyber-switch-thumb {
            position: absolute;
            top: 2px;
            left: 2px;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }
        .cyber-switch.on .cyber-switch-thumb {
            transform: translateX(26px);
        }
        .cyber-switch-text {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: #fff;
            top: 2px;
        }
        .cyber-switch.on .cyber-switch-text {
            left: 6px;
        }
        .cyber-switch:not(.on) .cyber-switch-text {
            right: 6px;
            color: #8c97a8;
        }

        .effects-section-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        /* 10 大基础效果网格排布 (参考图 1/2/3 标准布局) */
        .effects-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
            gap: 20px 16px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .effect-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 12px 6px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .effect-item:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }
        .effect-item.active {
            background: rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.05);
            border-color: rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.15);
        }
        .effect-item.active-cyan {
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
            border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .effect-icon-wrapper {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .effect-item:hover .effect-icon-wrapper {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            transform: scale(1.06);
        }
        .effect-item.active .effect-icon-wrapper {
            color: var(--rog-red);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.7));
        }
        .effect-item.active-cyan .effect-icon-wrapper {
            color: var(--rog-cyan);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.7));
        }

        .effect-label {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .effect-item:hover .effect-label { color: var(--text-primary); }
        .effect-item.active .effect-label {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .effect-item.active-cyan .effect-label {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* ----- 右侧：赛博参数调控卡片 (ASUS Cyber Box) ----- */
        .cyber-settings-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 22px 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 22px;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        /* 顶部 Micro-stripes 赛博条纹底纹 */
        .cyber-settings-card::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 18px;
            border-top-left-radius: 3px;
            border-top-right-radius: 3px;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                45deg,
                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 0,
                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 2px,
                transparent 2px,
                transparent 6px
            );
            pointer-events: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        }

        /* 四角准星切线 Corner Brackets */
        .corner-bracket {
            position: absolute;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            pointer-events: none;
            border-color: #434e62;
            border-style: solid;
        }
        .corner-tl { top: -1px; left: -1px; border-width: 2px 0 0 2px; }
        .corner-tr { top: -1px; right: -1px; border-width: 2px 2px 0 0; }
        .corner-bl { bottom: -1px; left: -1px; border-width: 0 0 2px 2px; }
        .corner-br { bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-width: 0 2px 2px 0; }

        /* 参数区块小节 */
        .param-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .param-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            letter-spacing: 0.4px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        /* 颜色单选 (样式 / 随机) */
        .color-radio-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .cyber-radio {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        .cyber-radio input[type="radio"] { display: none; }
        .radio-dot {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 1px solid #5a667d;
            background: #0f131a;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .cyber-radio input[type="radio"]:checked + .radio-dot {
            border-color: #fff;
        }
        .cyber-radio input[type="radio"]:checked + .radio-dot::after {
            content: "";
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #fff;
        }

        /* 预设下拉选择器 (默认样式 ▼) */
        .cyber-select-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .cyber-select {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #1a202c;
            border: 1px solid #333e52;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            appearance: none;
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .cyber-select:focus { border-color: var(--rog-cyan); }
        .cyber-select-arrow {
            position: absolute;
            right: 12px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            pointer-events: none;
            color: var(--rog-red);
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        /* 多阶渐变色条组件 (Gradient Stop Bar) */
        .gradient-editor-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .grad-btn {
            background: #1c222e;
            border: 1px solid #364257;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 2px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.15s;
        }
        .grad-btn:hover {
            color: #fff;
            border-color: #556685;
            background: #252e3d;
        }

        .gradient-track-container {
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
            height: 28px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .gradient-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff1929 0%, #148ac4 60%, #e040fb 100%);
            cursor: crosshair;
        }

        /* 渐变停靠手柄 (Stop Pin) */
        .gradient-stop-pin {
            position: absolute;
            top: -2px;
            width: 14px;
            height: 16px;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            border: 1px solid #ffffff;
            border-radius: 2px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .gradient-stop-pin.selected {
            transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.15);
            border-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ffffff;
            z-index: 3;
        }
        .gradient-stop-pin::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -5px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            border-width: 4px 4px 0 4px;
            border-style: solid;
            border-color: #fff transparent transparent transparent;
        }

        /* 模拟灯效组件 */
        .analog-box {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
        }
        .analog-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .analog-desc {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #7b889d;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }

        /* LED 亮度条 (发光青色 Cyan Track) */
        .cyber-slider-track {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 6px;
            background: #19202c;
            border-radius: 3px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .cyber-slider-fill {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #0088cc, var(--rog-cyan));
            border-radius: 3px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.5);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .cyber-slider-thumb {
            position: absolute;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.8), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.1s;
        }
        .cyber-slider-thumb:hover { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.15); }

        /* 速度档位滑块 (慢 / 正常 / 快) */
        .speed-ticks-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-top: 6px;
            padding: 0 2px;
        }
        .speed-step-track {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 4px;
            background: #252e3e;
            border-radius: 2px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .speed-tick-mark {
            position: absolute;
            width: 2px;
            height: 10px;
            background: #46556e;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            top: -3px;
        }
        .speed-thumb {
            position: absolute;
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #334257;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: left 0.15s ease;
        }

        /* 8 方向三角罗盘矩阵 (Direction Compass) */
        .direction-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 10px 8px;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            padding: 12px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        }
        .dir-btn {
            background: #151a23;
            border: 1px solid #2d384b;
            border-radius: 2px;
            height: 28px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #8c9bb0;
            transition: all 0.15s ease;
        }
        .dir-btn:hover {
            border-color: #4b5d7d;
            color: #ffffff;
            background: #1c2330;
        }
        .dir-btn.active {
            border-color: var(--rog-red);
            background: rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.15);
            color: var(--rog-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.4);
        }
        .dir-btn svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: currentColor; }

        /* 隐藏的色彩拾取器 */
        #hidden-color-picker {
            position: absolute;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            width: 0;
            height: 0;
        }

        /* 前台规则表格 */
        .rules-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .rules-table th {
            text-align: left;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .rules-table td {
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(45, 52, 68, 0.4);
        }
        .input-text {
            background-color: #1a202c;
            border: 1px solid #333e52;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            outline: none;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .input-text:focus { border-color: var(--rog-cyan); }

        /* 全屏优雅降级游戏遮罩 */
        #game-mode-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: rgba(7, 9, 13, 0.94);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 9999;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: opacity 0.35s ease;
        }
        #game-mode-overlay.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            pointer-events: all;
        }
        .game-card {
            background: #11151e;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.2);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 40px 50px;
            max-width: 540px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .game-icon { font-size: 44px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: inline-block; }
        .game-card h2 { font-size: 20px; color: var(--rog-red); margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 800; }
        .game-card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .pulse-status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 6px 18px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .pulse-ring {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: #ffcc00;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ffcc00;
            animation: pulse-ring 1.5s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse-ring {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(0.9); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.4); opacity: 0.4; }
        }

        #toast {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 28px;
            right: 28px;
            background: #18202d;
            border: 1px solid var(--rog-red);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 25, 41, 0.3);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(100px);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.18, 0.89, 0.32, 1.28);
            z-index: 1000;
        }
        #toast.show { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="header-left">
        <div class="rog-logo" title="ROG GearLink">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21.9 9.4L14 4.8 6.1 9.4l-.1 9.2 7.9 4.6 7.9-4.6.1-9.2zM14 6.8l5.8 3.4v6.8L14 20.4l-5.8-3.4v-6.8L14 6.8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-info">
            <h1>奥创极速网页版 <span class="tag">ROG FALCHION ACE HFX</span></h1>
            <p>ASUS GearLink 官方灯效设置中枢 · 127.0.0.1:19898</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
        <div class="status-badge" id="service-status">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            <span>硬件推流就绪 (25 FPS)</span>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-rog" onclick="saveConfiguration()">
            💾 保存并应用到设备
        </button>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <!-- ========================================================
         1. 顶部舞台：符合 official 规范的 68 键全物理虚拟键盘
         ======================================================== -->
    <div class="stage-container">
        <div class="stage-header">
            <div class="stage-title">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="var(--rog-red)"><path d="M20 5H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v10c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V7c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-9 3h2v2h-2V8zm0 3h2v2h-2v-2zM8 8h2v2H8V8zm0 3h2v2H8v-2zm-1 2H5v-2h2v2zm0-3H5V8h2v2zm8 7H9v-2h6v2zm1-4h-2v-2h2v2zm0-3h-2V8h2v2zm3 3h-2v-2h2v2zm0-3h-2V8h2v2z"/></svg>
                实时灯效预览 · 68 键全物理矩阵同步
            </div>
            <div class="stage-fps-badge" id="stage-badge">
                ● 预览时钟：60 FPS 硬件同步驱动
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 按照用户明确指定的需求：具备 "device-keyboard-module__keyboard" 类名 -->
        <div class="device-keyboard-module__keyboard" id="device-keyboard">
            <div class="device-keyboard-module__keyboard_base-layer" id="keyboard-base-layer">
                <!-- 5 排键盘布局由 JS 依据 calibrated_keymap.json 自动高精度生成 -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 选项卡导航条 -->
    <div class="tab-nav">
        <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchMainTab('lighting')">灯光效果设置</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchMainTab('rules')">前台自适应规则</button>
    </div>

    <!-- ========================================================
         2. Tab 1: 完美复刻 ASUS GearLink 参考图片的灯效设置界面
         ======================================================== -->
    <div id="tab-lighting-content" class="gearlink-main-panel">
        <!-- 左栏：基本效果选择网格 (参考图 1/2/3 左半部) -->
        <div class="effects-left-section">
            <div class="effects-top-bar">
                <div class="cyber-switch on" id="master-light-switch" onclick="toggleMasterLight()">
                    <span class="cyber-switch-text">ON</span>
                    <div class="cyber-switch-thumb"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="effects-section-title">基本效果</div>
            </div>

            <!-- 10 款基础灯效网格 -->
            <div class="effects-grid" id="effects-grid">
                <!-- 1. 恒亮 (Static) -->
                <div class="effect-item" data-id="static" onclick="selectEffect('static')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="currentColor">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"/>
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5" fill="currentColor"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">恒亮</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. 呼吸 (Breathing) -->
                <div class="effect-item" data-id="breathing" onclick="selectEffect('breathing')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M2 12h5l2.5-6 4 12 3.5-6h5"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">呼吸</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. 彩色循环 (Color Cycle) -->
                <div class="effect-item" data-id="color_cycle" onclick="selectEffect('color_cycle')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <path d="M20.5 12A8.5 8.5 0 0 0 6 6l-2 2"/>
                            <path d="M4 3v5h5"/>
                            <path d="M3.5 12a8.5 8.5 0 0 0 14.5 6l2-2"/>
                            <path d="M20 21v-5h-5"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">彩色循环</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 4. 触发 (Reactive) -->
                <div class="effect-item" data-id="reactive" onclick="selectEffect('reactive')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                            <ellipse cx="12" cy="8" rx="3.5" ry="5.5"/>
                            <ellipse cx="12" cy="16" rx="3.5" ry="5.5"/>
                            <ellipse cx="8" cy="12" rx="5.5" ry="3.5"/>
                            <ellipse cx="16" cy="12" rx="5.5" ry="3.5"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">触发</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 5. 彩虹 (Rainbow) -->
                <div class="effect-item active" data-id="wave" onclick="selectEffect('wave')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <path d="M4 19a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/>
                            <path d="M7.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 9 0"/>
                            <path d="M10.5 19a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">彩虹</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 6. 涟漪 (Ripple) -->
                <div class="effect-item" data-id="ripple" onclick="selectEffect('ripple')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5" fill="currentColor"/>
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.5"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">涟漪</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 7. 星空 (Starry Night) -->
                <div class="effect-item" data-id="starry_night" onclick="selectEffect('starry_night')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M4 8V4h4"/>
                            <path d="M20 8V4h-4"/>
                            <path d="M4 16v4h4"/>
                            <path d="M20 16v4h-4"/>
                            <path d="M12 7l1.5 3.5L17 12l-3.5 1.5L12 17l-1.5-3.5L7 12l3.5-1.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">星空</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 8. 流沙 (Quicksand) -->
                <div class="effect-item" data-id="quicksand" onclick="selectEffect('quicksand')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <path d="M3 8c2.5-2 5.5-2 8 0s5.5 2 8 0"/>
                            <path d="M3 13c2.5-2 5.5-2 8 0s5.5 2 8 0"/>
                            <path d="M3 18c2.5-2 5.5-2 8 0s5.5 2 8 0"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">流沙</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 9. 电流 (Current) -->
                <div class="effect-item" data-id="current" onclick="selectEffect('current')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M2 13h4l2.5-7 3.5 14 3-10 2.5 5 2-2h4"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">电流</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 10. 雨滴 (Raindrops) -->
                <div class="effect-item" data-id="raindrop" onclick="selectEffect('raindrop')">
                    <div class="effect-icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <path d="M7 4l-4 8"/>
                            <path d="M12 4l-4 16"/>
                            <path d="M17 4l-4 12"/>
                            <path d="M22 6l-4 10"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="effect-label">雨滴</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 右栏：ASUS 赛博参数卡片 (参考图 1/2/3 右半部) -->
        <div class="cyber-settings-card" id="cyber-settings-card">
            <!-- 四角准星切角 -->
            <div class="corner-bracket corner-tl"></div>
            <div class="corner-bracket corner-tr"></div>
            <div class="corner-bracket corner-bl"></div>
            <div class="corner-bracket corner-br"></div>

            <!-- 1. 颜色设置区 (Color) -->
            <div class="param-group" id="param-group-color">
                <div class="param-title">颜色</div>

                <!-- 样式 / 随机 单选 (参考图 3 星空效果) -->
                <div class="color-radio-row" id="color-radio-row" style="display: none;">
                    <label class="cyber-radio">
                        <input type="radio" name="color-mode" value="style" checked onchange="onColorModeChange('style')">
                        <span class="radio-dot"></span>
                        <span>样式</span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="cyber-radio">
                        <input type="radio" name="color-mode" value="random" onchange="onColorModeChange('random')">
                        <span class="radio-dot"></span>
                        <span>随机</span>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <!-- 预设样式下拉菜单 (默认样式 ▼) -->
                <div class="cyber-select-wrapper" id="preset-select-wrapper">
                    <select class="cyber-select" id="preset-theme-select" onchange="onPresetThemeChange(this.value)">
                        <option value="default">默认样式</option>
                        <option value="rainbow">彩虹全谱</option>
                        <option value="cyberpunk">赛博朋克</option>
                        <option value="aurora">极光之境</option>
                        <option value="lava">烈焰熔岩</option>
                        <option value="frost">冷艳冰霜</option>
                        <option value="single_red">ROG 专属红</option>
                    </select>
                    <span class="cyber-select-arrow">▼</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 多阶渐变条与加减按键 (参考图 1/3 核心特性) -->
                <div class="gradient-editor-row" id="gradient-editor-row">
                    <button class="grad-btn" title="删除当前选中的色标" onclick="removeSelectedStop()">−</button>
                    <div class="gradient-track-container" id="gradient-track-container" onclick="onGradientTrackClick(event)">
                        <div class="gradient-bar" id="gradient-bar"></div>
                        <!-- 动态生成色标手柄 -->
                    </div>
                    <button class="grad-btn" title="增加新色标" onclick="addGradientStop()">+</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. 模拟灯效 (Analog Effect Toggle, 参考图 1) -->
            <div class="analog-box" id="param-group-analog">
                <div class="analog-header">
                    <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;">模拟灯效</span>
                    <div class="cyber-switch" id="analog-switch" onclick="toggleAnalogSwitch()">
                        <span class="cyber-switch-text">OFF</span>
                        <div class="cyber-switch-thumb"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="analog-desc">
                    开启此设置时，按下的按键及周围按键将依按压深浅显示不同亮度及范围的灯效。
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. LED 亮度 (LED Brightness, 发光青色条) -->
            <div class="param-group" id="param-group-brightness">
                <div class="param-title">
                    <span>LED 亮度</span>
                    <span id="brightness-val-text" style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--rog-cyan); font-weight: 700;">100%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="cyber-slider-track" id="brightness-track" onmousedown="startDragBrightness(event)">
                    <div class="cyber-slider-fill" id="brightness-fill" style="width: 100%;"></div>
                    <div class="cyber-slider-thumb" id="brightness-thumb" style="left: 100%;"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 4. 速度 (Speed, 慢 / 正常 / 快 3 档滑块, 参考图 2) -->
            <div class="param-group" id="param-group-speed">
                <div class="param-title">速度</div>
                <div class="speed-step-track" id="speed-track" onmousedown="onSpeedTrackClick(event)">
                    <div class="speed-tick-mark" style="left: 0%;"></div>
                    <div class="speed-tick-mark" style="left: 50%;"></div>
                    <div class="speed-tick-mark" style="left: 100%;"></div>
                    <div class="speed-thumb" id="speed-thumb" style="left: 100%;"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="speed-ticks-row">
                    <span>慢</span>
                    <span>正常</span>
                    <span>快</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 5. 方向 (Direction 8 方向矩阵, 参考图 2) -->
            <div class="param-group" id="param-group-direction">
                <div class="param-title">方向</div>
                <div class="direction-grid">
                    <!-- 第一行: 上, 下, 左, 右, 右上 -->
                    <button class="dir-btn" data-dir="up" title="向上" onclick="setDirection('up')">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4l-8 8h16z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <button class="dir-btn" data-dir="down" title="向下" onclick="setDirection('down')">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20l-8-8h16z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <button class="dir-btn" data-dir="left" title="向左" onclick="setDirection('left')">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12l8-8v16z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <button class="dir-btn" data-dir="right" title="向右" onclick="setDirection('right')">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12l-8-8v16z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <button class="dir-btn" data-dir="diag_ur" title="右上" onclick="setDirection('diag_ur')">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 18L18 6v12z"/></svg>
                    </button>

                    <!-- 第二行: 左下(默认激活态), 左上, 右下, 往复扩散 -->
                    <button class="dir-btn active" data-dir="diag_dl" title="左下" onclick="setDirection('diag_dl')">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 6v12h12z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <button class="dir-btn" data-dir="diag_ul" title="左上" onclick="setDirection('diag_ul')">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 18L6 6h12z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <button class="dir-btn" data-dir="diag_dr" title="右下" onclick="setDirection('diag_dr')">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 6l12 12H6z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <button class="dir-btn" data-dir="spread" title="往复/扩散" onclick="setDirection('spread')">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12l5-5v10zm16 0l-5-5v10z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 6. 粗细 (Thickness, 参考图 2) -->
            <div class="param-group" id="param-group-thickness">
                <div class="param-title">
                    <span>粗细</span>
                    <span id="thickness-val-text" style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary);">1.0x</span>
                </div>
                <div class="cyber-slider-track" id="thickness-track" onmousedown="startDragThickness(event)">
                    <div class="cyber-slider-fill" id="thickness-fill" style="width: 50%; background: #3c495e;"></div>
                    <div class="cyber-slider-thumb" id="thickness-thumb" style="left: 50%;"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ========================================================
         3. Tab 2: 前台进程自适应规则设置
         ======================================================== -->
    <div id="tab-rules-content" class="gearlink-main-panel" style="display: none; grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
        <div class="effects-left-section" style="padding: 10px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;">前台进程专属灯效绑定规则</h2>
                <button class="btn-rog" onclick="addRule()">+ 添加新规则</button>
            </div>
            <table class="rules-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>程序文件名 (EXE)</th>
                        <th>关联灯效方案</th>
                        <th>进入游戏模式 (关闭WebUI)</th>
                        <th>操作</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="rules-tbody"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<!-- 全屏游戏模式优雅降级遮罩 -->
<div id="game-mode-overlay">
    <div class="game-card">
        <div class="game-icon">🎮</div>
        <h2>已进入游戏 / 性能抑制模式</h2>
        <p>检测到前台正在运行全屏游戏或标记了抑制标记的高性能程序。<br>为保障键盘硬件极速响应与系统零占用，配置服务已由守护进程自动暂停。</p>
        <div class="pulse-status">
            <span class="pulse-ring"></span>
            <span>切回桌面后界面将自动恢复...</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="toast"></div>
<input type="color" id="hidden-color-picker" onchange="onColorPickerSelected(this.value)">

<script>
// ========================================================
// 4. 68 键完整物理布局矩阵 (权威 calibrated_keymap.json 标准)
// ========================================================
